        "username": "skywhale",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/skywhale/{size}/5248_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-09-22T20:24:19.412Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It’s much easier to compare my thoughts to a list than make the list itself, so I will say that I agree with most of these, well done churro!</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"psychedelicchurro\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"30250\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/psychedelicchurro/48/6027_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> psychedelicchurro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Mocktriarch: Comparable</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This one would be my only strong contention. With a randomized team, Mocktriach seems to be easier, in my experiences.</p>",
