        "created_at": "2023-09-25T03:32:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I guess that’s true, and you’re right about irreducible damage making it easier. I generally was giving my thoughts without counterpicking strategies in mind, in which case I think the Mocktriarch is probably easier, but not by quite as much if you don’t have consistent access to irreducible or AoE.</p>",
